      "title": "DolarApp - the global account for people in LatAm",
      "tagline": "Send, receive and pay in pesos, reais or dollars - all from one account",
      "body": "Hello all! We are [Zach](https://www.linkedin.com/in/zachgarman/), [Alvaro](https://www.linkedin.com/in/alvaro-correa/) and [Fernando](https://www.linkedin.com/in/fterres/) and we are proud to officially launch [DolarApp](https://www.dolarapp.com/) – the global account for Mexico, Argentina, Colombia, and Brazil. With DolarApp you can\n\n* Dollarize your savings and earn 4% APY\n* Get your own US bank account details (ACH and Routing Number) and get paid without hassle\n* Spend internationally at the best rates, without hidden fees\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=66120&key=user_uploads/730279/e6f7d8b1-3fb0-4984-82a6-49584c992071)\n\n\\\n**Why did we build DolarApp?**\n\nThe three of us have spent a lot of time in Latin America and made great friends there. Friends who, simply because of where they were born, see their financial freedom limited: hyperinflation, bans on saving in USD, nightmares trying to move money in/out of their country and crazy fees when paying with a card when traveling.\n\nAfter spending a couple of years at Revolut, we learned that Fintech as we know it today is constrained by traditional financial systems, partners, and regulatory frameworks. We realized we could end those constraints by offering people in LatAm a better account for their everyday finances built on stablecoins, with focus on simplicity and away from typical crypto jargon and complexity.\n\n**Key benefits of DolarApp**\n\nWith DolarApp, you will be able to:\n\n* 🇺🇸 Get US bank account details without a Social Security Number\n* 📥 Pay and get paid from local bank accounts, receiving / withdrawing USDc immediately\n* 🌎 Spend internationally without hassle, at the best exchange rates\n* 💲 Dollarize your savings\n* 📈 Earn 4% on your balance annually, paid out second by second\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=66120&key=user_uploads/730279/65678393-8d08-4404-9375-bf98561c98ca)\n\n**The ask**\n\n* If you live in Mexico / Brazil / Colombia / Argentina, join DolarApp [here](https://dolarapp.onelink.me/SVAM/fnlwxe4b)\n* If you have employees/family/friends in those countries who could benefit of having DolarApp, share this link with them!",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/HCS-dolarapp-the-global-account-for-people-in-latam",
